      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LET'S GO LEGEND (1) ran below his best last time finishing seventh (31.06) over 525m at this track in a NG. Form at this distance is sound. Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Can atone. ELITE DOM (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (23.67) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Can turn it around this time. KOSTECKI (8) is in hot form winning his last two on end, the latest jumping from this same box to score in a Mix 2/3 at Dubbo (18.64). Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Should be in this for a long way. STEW BOB (3) should be thereabouts after narrowly missing most recently.",
